  "description_detailed": "To celebrate the 25th anniversary of the cinema release of the first chapter of Peter Jackson's trilogy, Monnaie de Paris will unveil a collection of precious coins dedicated to the legendary Lord of the Rings series in 2026. From the Shire to Mordor, the perilous journey of the Fellowship of the Ring is now engraved in metal, celebrating a mythical saga that has become a true pillar of the fantasy genre.In the depths of Moria, the Fellowship's escape comes to an abrupt halt on the bridge of Khazad-dûm. Gandalf steps forward alone, standing between his companions and a shadow from ancient times. Facing the Balrog, fire and darkness clash in a suspended moment, where time seems to hold its breath.‘You shall not pass!’This gesture marks a turning point. Through his sacrifice, Gandalf offers the Fellowship a chance to continue on their way, at the cost of his own fall into the abyss.",
